{"4614620": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Soulsmith", "steam_appid": 4614620, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soulsmith is a dark fantasy dungeon crawler focused on progression, exploration, and combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a world that feels ancient, broken, and alive. What begins as a simple task quickly pulls you deeper into something far more dangerous.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight your way through handcrafted zones, uncover hidden paths, and face enemies that grow stronger the deeper you go.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your character through multiple guilds, each offering unique skills and playstyles. Experiment with different builds and find what suits your way of fighting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare for brutal encounters, powerful bosses, and a world that doesn’t reveal its secrets easily.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FEATURES:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Multiple guilds with distinct skill trees  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Combat-driven progression  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Interconnected zones with hidden paths  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Challenging enemies and boss encounters  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• A mysterious world to explore  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The deeper you go, the harder it gets.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soulsmith is a dark fantasy dungeon crawler focused on progression, exploration, and combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a world that feels ancient, broken, and alive. What begins as a simple task quickly pulls you deeper into something far more dangerous.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight your way through handcrafted zones, uncover hidden paths, and face enemies that grow stronger the deeper you go.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your character through multiple guilds, each offering unique skills and playstyles. Experiment with different builds and find what suits your way of fighting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare for brutal encounters, powerful bosses, and a world that doesn’t reveal its secrets easily.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FEATURES:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Multiple guilds with distinct skill trees  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Combat-driven progression  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Interconnected zones with hidden paths  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Challenging enemies and boss encounters  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• A mysterious world to explore  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The deeper you go, the harder it gets.</p>", "short_description": "A dark fantasy dungeon crawler focused on progression, combat, and exploration. Master powerful guild skills, fight through dangerous zones, and uncover what lies beneath a cursed world.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4614620/ac5c8e1feadb1036a440e9107dc2a4361e4d59dc/header.jpg?t=1786146443", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4614620/ac3f1efebace0a1094402ff696f3cab62ce55a37/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786146443", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4614620/ac3f1efebace0a1094402ff696f3cab62ce55a37/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786146443", "website": "https://n1ghtmarestudios.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5-2400 / AMD equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 960 / AMD equivalentz<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Any</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</stro